{"about_the_game":"In <strong>Sleepy Heroes you</strong> can try to create the best <strong>synergy</strong> in each round. You can complete your rounds like <strong>solving a puzzle</strong> by sorting your cards, and face off against sleepy creatures.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164490/extras/SteamGifPlay.gif?t=1727424352\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Like solving a puzzle!</strong></h2>In <strong>Auto-Battler</strong> style battles, you can sit back and <strong>relax</strong> with the special mechanic of sequencing your cards in order. The <strong>order in which you play</strong> cards is very important in Sleepy Heroes. Grasp this original mechanic to create <strong>great combos</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164490/extras/SteamGifLoop.gif?t=1727424352\" /><br><br>In each battle, choose <strong>temporary cards</strong> and try them out. Build your strategy by adding <strong>permanent cards</strong> when you win a battle.<br>Power up your deck with dozens of different <strong>Trinkets</strong>.<br>Make choices in <strong>events</strong> and <strong>shops</strong>. Defeat tough elites to reach the <strong>last boss</strong>.<br>Enjoy <strong>Lo-Fi</strong> music and capture different synergies over and over again.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164490?t=1727424352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164490?t=1727424352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164490/140a033ef319522ee9af3cae752ca24cd6706ec9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727424352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164490/140a033ef319522ee9af3cae752ca24cd6706ec9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727424352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de